<h1 class="h2 mb-3">About HomeHunt</h1>

<p>HomeHunt is a small real estate site. Visitors can search properties for sale and for rent, filter them by city, type, price, bedrooms and area, and open a property to see its details and the agent who lists it.</p>

<p>Properties, locations and agents can be added through the site, and properties can be edited and deleted.</p>
